---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Terms of service — Publitools';
const description = 'Terms of service for Publitools.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/terms-of-service" locale="en" pathname="/en/terms-of-service/">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Contractual documents</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Terms of service</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Purpose</h2><p class="mt-4">These terms define the conditions of access and use of the Publitools website and services.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Access to the service</h2><p class="mt-4">Access to certain features may require account creation, a subscription or validation by the publisher. The user is responsible for keeping their credentials confidential.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Authorised use</h2><p class="mt-4">The user agrees to use the service in a fair, reasonable and lawful manner, in compliance with applicable regulations. Any fraudulent, abusive, deceptive or harmful use is prohibited.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Content liability</h2><p class="mt-4">Content, messages, visuals, descriptions, publications, reviews or any other element distributed via Publitools remain the responsibility of the user who validates or uses them.</p><p class="mt-4">The user must verify the accuracy, compliance and relevance of the content before publishing.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Availability</h2><p class="mt-4">The publisher strives to ensure reasonable availability of the service. However, temporary interruptions may occur for maintenance, updates, technical incidents or external constraints.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. Service evolution</h2><p class="mt-4">Publitools may modify, enhance, suspend or remove certain features in order to evolve the product, strengthen its security or adapt it to third-party platforms and the targeted professional uses.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. Intellectual property</h2><p class="mt-4">All site and service elements remain protected by applicable intellectual property rights. No reproduction, exploitation or reuse right is granted beyond normal use of the service.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">8. Suspension and closure</h2><p class="mt-4">In case of non-compliance with these terms, abusive use, harm to the service or contractual breach, the publisher may suspend or limit access to all or part of the service.</p></section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>